@startuml Flight Registration and Notification Sequence

actor User
participant "Central Service" as Central
participant "Flight Service" as FlightSvc
participant "Notification Calculator" as NotifCalc
database "Database" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as Queue
participant "Queue Consumer" as Consumer
participant "Flight Monitor" as Monitor
participant "Notification Dispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Email Service" as Email

== User Registration and Flight Setup ==
User -> Central: Register Account
Central -> DB: Store User Data
Central --> User: Account Created

User -> Central: Register Flight Details
Central -> FlightSvc: Create Flight Record
FlightSvc -> DB: Store Flight
FlightSvc -> NotifCalc: Calculate Notification Times
NotifCalc -> DB: Read Flight & User Data
NotifCalc -> NotifCalc: Calculate Optimal Timing
NotifCalc -> DB: Store Notification Schedule
NotifCalc --> User: Flight Registered Successfully

== Background: External Services Update ==
note over Queue
    Schiphol Service and Google Maps Service
    continuously poll their APIs and push
    updates to RabbitMQ queues
end note

"Schiphol Service" -> Queue: Push Flight Delay Update
"Google Maps Service" -> Queue: Push Traffic Update

== Message Processing ==
Consumer -> Queue: Consume Flight Update
Consumer -> Monitor: Process Flight Update
Monitor -> DB: Retrieve Flight Details
Monitor -> Monitor: Evaluate Significance

alt Significant Update Detected
    Monitor -> DB: Update Flight Status
    Monitor -> DB: Check Notification Rules
    Monitor -> NotifCalc: Recalculate Timing
    NotifCalc -> DB: Update Notification Schedule
    Monitor -> Dispatcher: Trigger Notification
    Dispatcher -> DB: Get User Details
    Dispatcher -> Email: Send Notification Email
    Email --> User: Delay Alert Email
    Dispatcher -> DB: Mark Notification as Sent
else Minor Update
    Monitor -> DB: Log Update
    note right: No user notification needed
end

== Scheduled Notification ==
Dispatcher -> DB: Check Pending Notifications
Dispatcher -> Dispatcher: Find Due Notifications
Dispatcher -> Email: Send Departure Reminder
Email --> User: Time to Leave for Airport
Dispatcher -> DB: Mark as Sent

@enduml
